{"title": "Elven Weapon Training", "pageid": 6572, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elven_Weapon_Training", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elven_Weapon_Training.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Elven_Weapon_Training.webp/300px-Elven_Weapon_Training.webp, /w/images/c/c2/Elven_Weapon_Training.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Elven_Weapon_Training.webp/300px-Elven_Weapon_Training.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Elven_Weapon_Training.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Elven Weapon Training</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elves</a> proficiency with the Longsword, Shortsword, Shortbow, and Longbow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longswords\" title=\"Longswords\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Longswords_Icon.png/25px-Longswords_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Longswords_Icon.png/38px-Longswords_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Longswords_Icon.png/50px-Longswords_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Longswords\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Longswords_Icon.png/25px-Longswords_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Longswords_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Longswords\" title=\"Longswords\">Longswords</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/38px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/50px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shortswords\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortswords</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longbows\" title=\"Longbows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/25px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/38px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/50px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Longbows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png/25px-Longbows_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Longbows_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Longbows\" title=\"Longbows\">Longbows</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shortbows\" title=\"Shortbows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Shortbows_Icon.png/25px-Shortbows_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Shortbows_Icon.png/38px-Shortbows_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Shortbows_Icon.png/50px-Shortbows_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shortbows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Shortbows_Icon.png/25px-Shortbows_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Shortbows_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shortbows\" title=\"Shortbows\">Shortbows</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elf</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zenith_Feur%27sel\" title=\"Zenith Feur'sel\">Zenith Feur'sel</a></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1172/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7336/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2966/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 211/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 804666/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.529      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.529      1 -total\n 4